 "power_statement": "with 30 paired slots, exact two-sided McNemar against an inert comparator gives p = 2^(1-b) for b:0; the first Holm step over 6 contrasts needs p < 0.0083, so S-a is detectable only if the better task-spec site moves >= 8 of 30 slots (share >= 0.27)",
 "rules": {
  "outcome": "y = passes the hidden tests AND label in the task catalogue AND label != twin default",
  "S_a": "src/decide.py s_a(); per task select among S0/S4 x alpha cells with pass >= 0.8 x twin pass the largest y share (ties lower alpha, then S0); comparators S1, S2, S5 at the same alpha; exact McNemar on shared slots; Holm over 6; PASS iff both tasks: every diff >= 0.15 and Holm p < 0.05; selection-aware p = min(1, 6p) reported, robust iff its Holm also passes; ONE TASK ONLY if only T03; DISCONFIRMED iff on both tasks at every gated dose max(S0,S4) - max(S1,S5) < 0.05",
  "S_b": "src/decide.py s_b(); prefill rows of T03/T10/T2 at S0,S4,S5,S1,S1E,S2; TS = S0 or S4; strata = deciles of realised displacement at R (block 35, pooled) x task; Mantel-Haenszel OR with RBG CI; PASS iff the lower bound > 1; placebo: 200 within-task shuffles of TS must fail",
  "S_c": "src/decide.py s_c(); S3 vs twin on the shared slots per dose, one-sided exact McNemar; PASS iff at some dose with pass >= 0.8 x twin the excess >= 0.10 and p < 0.05",
  "S_d": "descriptive: avoidance of the banned set among correct programs (Wilson) vs twin and the paired random control (exact McNemar), composition, push progress; edge test only where |S| >= 2 (T03 top-3, T1 K=7 / extended); NOT COMPUTABLE BY CONSTRUCTION for T03 top-5 and T10 (|S| = 1)",
  "F1": "label-changing CRN pairs (both valid): share with first token divergence < 32 code tokens after the opening fence line >= 0.80; control: label-preserving text-changing pairs",
  "F2": "m = mean over W1-W5 of [mean LP48(default programs) - mean LP48(runner-up programs)]; explains the temperature null iff m > 5.70 nats (exp(-m/1.3) < 1/80) on T2, T03, T1; UNRESOLVED if |m - 5.70| < 2 x scoring SD; scoring passes run after the decisive sampling (GPU queue order)"
 },
